 "note": "J1a = config M end to end inside the F2 sandbox (--config M): link to the passed J0 (gates.py link; launch --pull r1/runs/<j0>/out/files/=/work/j0/), the rank (rankrepro's commands: rk6_requests build, the unedited RK6b rerun, rank gate, rank tables), calls, events, the outcome patch (the launch adds --pull r1/patch_raw/<tag>/=/work/patch_raw/<tag>/ per tag in config M sections.patch.tags), the econ (econ920_m) and chem/maths (chemmath_m on the N2 shadow) frames, A_far, the assembled frames ($WORK/prod/frames, R10), the paper-side extractions, the memory probe (3k), the 27 M cells (V3-ONE: main + evcl, evcl refs from this run's main cells), the M estimates dir (work:prod/estimates_M), promotion and the sandbox check. rank_m and rank_tables read October products by <repo>/data/cal2026-10/<file>; the sandbox moved those, so the two stages run on a per-stage view of the clone that links the named files from the read-only reference copy (allowlisted per stage). Chem/maths coverage runs inside chemmath_m (no coverage_chemmath row). F20 (star departures) is out of scope (author 2026-10-15). W3-FLIPS sets complete after the R7 review.",
